NCPGD-E third-party notice
============================

This repository's point-cloud denoising architecture and source profile are
based on the following project:

  Guo et al., "Guiding Point Cloud Denoising with Learned Structural Priors"
  https://github.com/git-guocc/PGD
  source revision: b5dc8be352203cfb2a417be6d0e3e9a0cb1f196f
  license: MIT

The released NCPGD-E implementation is a Jittor adaptation for the Sixth CG
Graphics AI Challenge. It contains no PGD pretrained weights, no official
competition dataset, and no third-party source tree.
